    lesson: 'This course is the capstone of the department, and it opens on the metric rather than on a method, because every practice downstream is an answer to one sentence: "Moreover it is required in stewards, that a man be found faithful" (1 Corinthians 4:2). A steward is a person running something that belongs to another — which, given where this department started, is every property holder alive. And the requirement is FAITHFUL. Read what that rules out. It rules out yield as the primary measure, which is the measure the trade actually uses and the one an owner asks for first. A manager can post a strong year on a rising market while cutting every corner in it. Another can lose money through a hard winter and be faithful in every particular. Those two are graded on the same scale, and the market is not the scale. NOW WHERE IS THE MEASUREMENT TAKEN? At the smallest scale available: "He that is faithful in that which is least is faithful also in much: and he that is unjust in the least is unjust also in much" (Luke 16:10). Most of us carry the opposite assumption — that small matters are practice and the real test arrives with real money. Jesus says the small matter IS the test, and notice the symmetry in the second half, because that is the part that convicts: He does not say the unjust in the least will LATER become unjust in much. He says he is unjust in much, now. Present character, not future risk. Nobody is unfaithful for the first time with a hundred thousand dollars; they practised on twenty, and the practice was already the thing. THE OPERATIONAL CONSEQUENCE is a discipline most managers resist, because it is unglamorous and nobody applauds it. The primary instruments of faithfulness are the routine, uninspected duties: the call returned when you said, the deduction itemised and evidenced, the receipt kept, the repair logged the day it was done, the deposit accounted to the dollar. An owner who reviews only the totals is reading the least informative number on the page. AND HEAR THE ENCOURAGEMENT IN IT, because there is one. If the measurement is taken at the least, then a man managing one rental is not waiting for scale to be tested — he is being tested now, on terms he can actually meet. Faithful is available to him today. Large may never be.',
